      "message": "test(ui): structural shell tests read the pinned toolbar version\n\nThe structural shell tests (PR #359) built their expected build label\nfrom CARGO_PKG_VERSION, but tests pin the toolbar version (#449/#450),\nand a crowded ribbon paints the version alone. The test now takes the\nversion from build_info::toolbar_version and accepts either the full or\nthe compact label.\n\nFixes #556\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
